We are actually very open-minded regarding community sharing and modpack creation! The primary reason this mod is distributed under an "All Rights Reserved" license rather than an open-source license (like MIT) is simply that we want to ensure the integrity of the code. We do not want unauthorized modifications or tweaked versions of our code floating around. As long as you respect the code's integrity and the artists' hard work, feel free to enjoy the mod and include it in your modpacks!

