1. GENERAL RESTRICTIONS
To protect the integrity of the Software, you are NOT permitted to:
- Decompile, reverse engineer, or modify the source code or binaries (.jar file) of the Software.
- Extract, copy, distribute, or reuse any art assets (textures, models, etc.) or audio files included in the Software in other projects, mods, or media.
- Re-upload or redistribute the Software on any website or platform outside of the official distribution channels (e.g., official CurseForge or Modrinth pages managed by Saku_rain).
- Use the Software or any of its components for any commercial purposes.

2. MODPACK POLICY (WE LOVE MODPACKS!)
You are completely free and warmly welcome to include the Software in your Minecraft Modpacks, provided that:
- The Modpack is distributed through official, approved platforms (such as CurseForge or Modrinth).
- No direct monetary compensation is charged for access to the Software itself (standard platform reward programs for modpack creators are completely fine).
- Modification Clarification: Modpack creators are 100% allowed and encouraged to use Data packs, Resource packs, config files, or tools like KubeJS/CraftTweaker to modify recipes, loot tables, and configurations. The "no modification" rule in Section 1 ONLY applies to reverse-engineering or altering the mod's actual Java code and compiled `.jar` file.

3. ART ASSETS & DESIGN INSPIRATION NOTICE
All textures, models, and art assets present in this Software are 100% original creations, drawn primarily by MHanHanBing. While the design concepts and functional ideas are heavily inspired by the original 1.12.2 mod "Ender IO Endergy", NO actual graphical assets or code from the 1.12.2 project are used within this Software. Therefore, all art assets within this Software fall strictly under this All Rights Reserved license and are protected against unauthorized use.

